# Generated test artifacts — device captures and offline-analysis dumps, not
# source. These are produced by the scripts here (duplex/erle/loopback/voice
# captures, event logs, tap dumps, correlation caches) and there can be
# hundreds of them; none are meant to be committed.
#
# Scripts (*.py, *.lua) and docs (*.md) stay tracked. If a specific data file
# should ever be committed as a fixture, force it: `git add -f <file>`.
*.wav
*.lc3
*.jsonl
*.npy
*.npz
*.log
